      "Actor": "Nyccolhoth Lhavyniwyn",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I spy an ancient, weathered stone cross on a stepped base, its carving worn to a whisper. Yet, 'tis nothing worth doing, so I'll jest and shift my gaze to something lighter.",
